\\frac{1}{{[\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\theta )+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\theta )]}^{6}} & ={[\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\theta )+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\theta )]}^{-6} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(-6\\theta )+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-6\\theta ).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, using the fact that $\\operatorname{cos}⁡(-\\phi )=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\phi )$ and $\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-\\phi )=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\phi )$ for any input $\\phi ,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡(-6\\theta )+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-6\\theta )=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6\\theta )-\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6\\theta ).\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14055661/state.json" "file_sha256" "e0b664fdfc17c5a0fb0cc22c02ac3b466d1e7a3a6eb1dd000f6857931357ba7d"} {"question" "q-71452" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14055661/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "e2392448160f40f4b2950be85e254ffe26679a0f9efd98c33f481c3aa954de7e"} {"question" "q-71452" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14055661/state.json" "file_sha256" "e0b664fdfc17c5a0fb0cc22c02ac3b466d1e7a3a6eb1dd000f6857931357ba7d"} {"question" "q-71452" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3\\theta )+2\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3\\theta )"] ["math" "3\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\theta )-3\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\theta )"] ["math" "6\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\theta )+6\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\theta )"] ["math" "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6\\theta )+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6\\theta )"] ["math" "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6\\theta )-\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6\\theta )"]] "category" 